  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"a89ba076\" id=\"a89ba076\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a3157ff\" id=\"u1a3157ff\">什么是自由度</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uf87d4152\" id=\"uf87d4152\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6c76c3b6\" id=\"u6c76c3b6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u10e357e8\" id=\"u10e357e8\">自由度全称 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9c0ddeee\" id=\"u9c0ddeee\">Degrees of Freedom</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1589ca49\" id=\"u1589ca49\">，简称 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u24206abf\" id=\"u24206abf\">DoF</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua56d824f\" id=\"ua56d824f\"> 。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7f4c7c04\" id=\"u7f4c7c04\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucfac6624\" id=\"ucfac6624\">自由度是用最少的数据配置来描述物体在空间中位置或形态。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"e25c9c30\" id=\"e25c9c30\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3d893380\" id=\"u3d893380\">空间位置描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ubfe2d121\" id=\"ubfe2d121\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"1848c779\" id=\"1848c779\"><span data-lake-id=\"u26dcd903\" id=\"u26dcd903\">一维空间的点</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uaa4e1d49\" id=\"uaa4e1d49\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1697700975078-19f8926d-f6cf-4a8b-ac18-4d23da6f2410.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u278b1f9c-51fa-4039-acb8-158f2e66d59%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u86fe3669-b81e-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A218.88888549804688%2C%22height%22%3A31%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%227.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A2086%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A299%2C%22originHeight%22%3A42%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ue8d90ef9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7adf0759\" id=\"u7adf0759\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1ebaae4b\" id=\"u1ebaae4b\">在一维空间的线段中，我们来描述一个点，我们通常用一个数字描述。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf5c270be\" id=\"uf5c270be\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1ebce161\" id=\"u1ebce161\">例如上图：</span></p><ul list=\"u43e1804d\"><li fid=\"uc3d6c38b\" data-lake-id=\"u930c3eac\" id=\"u930c3eac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3eb61b07\" id=\"u3eb61b07\">我们描述蓝色的点的位置用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf040fec2\" id=\"uf040fec2\">1</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ued1e843f\" id=\"ued1e843f\"> 可以准确的表达。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"j2sZS\" id=\"j2sZS\"><span data-lake-id=\"u74e9ee02\" id=\"u74e9ee02\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">二维空间的单点</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u6055e6d4\" id=\"u6055e6d4\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1697701057294-f61637f3-d979-420b-a8ff-1d508ba6e8d0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u2a58723d-9062-4fd7-84b3-5e2430ab839%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uaaad183c-6c36-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A234.8888931274414%2C%22height%22%3A201%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%228.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A4396%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A281%2C%22originHeight%22%3A240%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u362a7e08%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3f24d14d\" id=\"u3f24d14d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5bdb9ef1\" id=\"u5bdb9ef1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">在二维空间中，我们描述一个点，我们通常用横纵坐标来进行描述。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u12af2cdd\" id=\"u12af2cdd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua9edd322\" id=\"ua9edd322\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">如上图:</span></p><ul list=\"u31a45df4\"><li fid=\"u099a6882\" data-lake-id=\"u3d2505b8\" id=\"u3d2505b8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2a62bc2b\" id=\"u2a62bc2b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">我们描述蓝色的点的位置用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u860d8c4d\" id=\"u860d8c4d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">(3,2)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubda23af7\" id=\"ubda23af7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 就可以准确的表达。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"RajPY\" id=\"RajPY\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue9bb9dc7\" id=\"ue9bb9dc7\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">二维空间的两点</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u5f1cf44b\" id=\"u5f1cf44b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua30e4dcb\" id=\"ua30e4dcb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">如果我们要描述两个点，如下图:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3d7e81be\" id=\"u3d7e81be\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1697701151069-eb6ffa8f-ba48-43bf-b433-cfae476e8e31.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22udee8e3fc-497c-4542-a2a9-432e785d1bb%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u39267d17-216d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A255.8888931274414%2C%22height%22%3A219%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%229.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A4836%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A281%2C%22originHeight%22%3A240%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ubb3ab9df%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u065ffbaa\" id=\"u065ffbaa\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubb0d5e17\" id=\"ubb0d5e17\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">我们要描述蓝色的点和红色的点，那么我们可以用连个坐标点来进行描述：</span></p><ul list=\"ud76bf10d\"><li fid=\"u5f4339ae\" data-lake-id=\"u7eb36aa1\" id=\"u7eb36aa1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc3a7d0d1\" id=\"uc3a7d0d1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">蓝点 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub4e8e122\" id=\"ub4e8e122\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">(2, 1)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4a43f042\" id=\"u4a43f042\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 红点 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7b0cda4b\" id=\"u7b0cda4b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">(4, 3)</span></strong></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"hrVas\" id=\"hrVas\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41980b19\" id=\"u41980b19\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">二维空间中的线段</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u9df66f27\" id=\"u9df66f27\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1697701190254-d87843df-d023-40ed-b235-8e9228dc6f46.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf1be5edf-796b-4389-a713-f26eadcc0ba%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u39267d17-216d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A253.8888931274414%2C%22height%22%3A217%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%2210.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A5324%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A281%2C%22originHeight%22%3A240%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2cf3ef8c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u873808fe\" id=\"u873808fe\"><span data-lake-id=\"uffe9fae4\" id=\"uffe9fae4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">在二维空间中，我们如果要去描述一个线段，该如何去准确表达呢。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7c9e3813\" id=\"u7c9e3813\"><span data-lake-id=\"u11a0ad00\" id=\"u11a0ad00\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">我们可以：</span></p><ul list=\"ufcbfb609\"><li fid=\"u320765e9\" data-lake-id=\"u13e9e352\" id=\"u13e9e352\"><span data-lake-id=\"u98e85336\" id=\"u98e85336\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">描述起始点和结束点，起始点(2,1) 结束点(4, 3)</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u15bf7f2b\" id=\"u15bf7f2b\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc6c12797\" id=\"uc6c12797\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Note</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua76f9252\" id=\"ua76f9252\"><span data-lake-id=\"u18865342\" id=\"u18865342\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">我们所有的数学问题都是为了解决现实生活的。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u76783cb9\" id=\"u76783cb9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ff0367a\" id=\"u0ff0367a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">我们如果将线段看成一条棍子，如何在一个桌子上去描述棍子的位置呢？</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"WJ1x0\" id=\"WJ1x0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u116e764c\" id=\"u116e764c\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">认识自由度</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"D4guU\" id=\"D4guU\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue904866c\" id=\"ue904866c\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">二维空间中的棍子</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u6a71bb86\" id=\"u6a71bb86\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1697701218530-8cda9c14-4c34-42e5-8a05-db555179b2eb.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud690c744-5dbe-4033-aa3f-5b2269e1d50%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u39267d17-216d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A261.8888854980469%2C%22height%22%3A224%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%2211.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A6001%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A281%2C%22originHeight%22%3A240%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2d3d6b75%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u69843cda\" id=\"u69843cda\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3276d43e\" id=\"u3276d43e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">我们将桌子看成一个坐标系，那么我们如果用大白话去描述棍子的位置，我们会说:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u17e9db0f\" id=\"u17e9db0f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufc04877b\" id=\"ufc04877b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">棍子斜着朝上摆在靠上的地方</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u188fdc07\" id=\"u188fdc07\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1300ea23\" id=\"u1300ea23\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue1e56cd0\" id=\"ue1e56cd0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">这种描述并不准确，但是说明了两个问题：</span></p><ul list=\"u851f8cc9\"><li fid=\"ue76513e9\" data-lake-id=\"uda87c9a0\" id=\"uda87c9a0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6919666f\" id=\"u6919666f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">斜着朝上</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc8f44277\" id=\"uc8f44277\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 说明的是角度</span></li><li fid=\"ue76513e9\" data-lake-id=\"ue42c47e3\" id=\"ue42c47e3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"udb846e03\" id=\"udb846e03\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">靠上</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf40f4af8\" id=\"uf40f4af8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">说明的是位置</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ue03e9cac\" id=\"ue03e9cac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u080c774b\" id=\"u080c774b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">如果我们准确的去表达：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u27ff2ddb\" id=\"u27ff2ddb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u38add8b7\" id=\"u38add8b7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">棍子起始坐标点为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3d02db3d\" id=\"u3d02db3d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">(2,1)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u689d0913\" id=\"u689d0913\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 的位置，角度是</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufe2b2cd1\" id=\"ufe2b2cd1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">45度</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9d4430b5\" id=\"u9d4430b5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5bdd817b\" id=\"u5bdd817b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Note</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u497507a7\" id=\"u497507a7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2182f6aa\" id=\"u2182f6aa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">这里值得思考的是，描述以上问题时，是有前置条件的：</span></p><ul list=\"ud276d907\"><li fid=\"u4cff761b\" data-lake-id=\"u82b232e9\" id=\"u82b232e9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45d34071\" id=\"u45d34071\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">棍子的长度是确定的。</span></li><li fid=\"u4cff761b\" data-lake-id=\"u103f2605\" id=\"u103f2605\"><span data-lake-id=\"u15b062d1\" id=\"u15b062d1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">角度起始位置问题。</span></li><li fid=\"u4cff761b\" data-lake-id=\"u62966edc\" id=\"u62966edc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u718c9566\" id=\"u718c9566\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">角度旋转的正负方向问题。</span></li><li fid=\"u4cff761b\" data-lake-id=\"ud781bc69\" id=\"ud781bc69\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a081d97\" id=\"u1a081d97\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">坐标系如何摆放问题。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u95877328\" id=\"u95877328\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4eeb777\" id=\"ud4eeb777\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">角度起始：我们将x轴正向定义为角度起始点。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud080c6ce\" id=\"ud080c6ce\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf7c8c880\" id=\"uf7c8c880\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">角度旋转正负：逆时针定义为正向，顺时针定义为负向。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc1f656ec\" id=\"uc1f656ec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u445b6774\" id=\"u445b6774\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">坐标系摆放：坐标系其实可以随意摆放，摆放不同，位置描述就不同。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"rTALm\" id=\"rTALm\"><span data-lake-id=\"u64ac573a\" id=\"u64ac573a\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">棍子的思考</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u61a428a5\" id=\"u61a428a5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u317cae2f\" id=\"u317cae2f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">棍子是摆放在桌子上的，那么我们是不是可以随时改变棍子的位置呢？</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1924eace\" id=\"u1924eace\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1697701290416-0fbc8ecf-1bfe-4437-9f0f-06b48708c0e6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9f39c9a6-0636-4f9d-991c-f63a21c832b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u39267d17-216d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A553.3238525390625%2C%22height%22%3A158%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%2212.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A15295%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A840%2C%22originHeight%22%3A240%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub39b3e56%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2a653f83\" id=\"u2a653f83\"><span data-lake-id=\"u38693f68\" id=\"u38693f68\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">通过上图，我们可以得出一个结论：</span></p><ul list=\"u78ef3d07\"><li fid=\"u245c34b1\" data-lake-id=\"u0cfa9bd2\" id=\"u0cfa9bd2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41a635a7\" id=\"u41a635a7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">可以控制棍子的平移位置</span></li><li fid=\"u245c34b1\" data-lake-id=\"u964fd631\" id=\"u964fd631\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd68fd2a\" id=\"ucd68fd2a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">可以控制棍子的旋转姿态</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u3cd174c3\" id=\"u3cd174c3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u202d79f6\" id=\"u202d79f6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">哪什么是自由度呢?</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u83cc7f8b\" id=\"u83cc7f8b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u90b273a6\" id=\"u90b273a6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">对于棍子来说，可以水平垂直移动，可以旋转，这个就是自由，这个就是自由度。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u419d02fd\" id=\"u419d02fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u69e90060\" id=\"u69e90060\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">准确的说，自由度表现在位移和旋转的能力上。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc8fdeca7\" id=\"uc8fdeca7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07851de8\" id=\"u07851de8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">对于当前的状况而言，棍子和桌子构成了一个系统，这个系统中，棍子具备了一定的自由度。这个自由度表现在，可以水平移动，可以垂直移动，可以旋转。那么我们可以说棍子具备</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u79c135e9\" id=\"u79c135e9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">3个自由度</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uabeedd00\" id=\"uabeedd00\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf546a05e\" id=\"uf546a05e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u69de14bd\" id=\"u69de14bd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">​</span><br></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u76c27ec5\" id=\"u76c27ec5\" class=\"lake-alert lake-alert-warning\"><p data-lake-id=\"ue0d87f41\" id=\"ue0d87f41\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u14a88360\" id=\"u14a88360\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">小结:</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uae802ed5\" id=\"uae802ed5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc65235cb\" id=\"uc65235cb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">在二维空间中，自由度体现在 水平移动，垂直移动，旋转三个方面。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubd5b771f\" id=\"ubd5b771f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u417eac65\" id=\"u417eac65\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">通常我们会说某某物体有几个自由度，说的就是他是否具备移动和旋转方面的自由度。</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"u2c18bf11\" id=\"u2c18bf11\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc116c441\" id=\"uc116c441\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2988b82a\" id=\"u2988b82a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">思考:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc7cbef67\" id=\"uc7cbef67\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2b533e5\" id=\"ub2b533e5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">如果是三维空间，那么自由度主要是指那几个方面？</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"xinCC\" id=\"xinCC\"><span data-lake-id=\"u79d62dfe\" id=\"u79d62dfe\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">固定的连杆</span><span data-lake-id=\"ufe550a86\" id=\"ufe550a86\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u60accc7a\" id=\"u60accc7a\"> </span><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1697701319156-c99b66c1-e15e-46c9-aede-b017209202b7.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u587876e6-eda8-4dd4-b47f-248964c9004%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u39267d17-216d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A254.8888931274414%2C%22height%22%3A218%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%2213.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A6353%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A281%2C%22originHeight%22%3A240%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufc977d9a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u4321a899\" id=\"u4321a899\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36972a35\" id=\"u36972a35\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">如上图，在二维的空间中，现在存在一个连杆，其中蓝色的一端是固定在桌子上的。那么对于这个连杆而言，他具备几个自由度呢？</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5498c114\" id=\"u5498c114\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1697701343061-9a57b329-400c-44bf-bf4c-340d8b87513e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uc7984140-9bbe-4645-9fc6-9007132a1eb%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u39267d17-216d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A248%2C%22height%22%3A250%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%2214.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A10441%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A306%2C%22originHeight%22%3A308%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud9c14271%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufefe695d\" id=\"ufefe695d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8db6bba4\" id=\"u8db6bba4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">由于一端已经固定，整个木棍是不可以再移动了，只能围绕着这个固定的点进行旋转，因此只有旋转方面的自由度。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"KGeoX\" id=\"KGeoX\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c5843c6\" id=\"u1c5843c6\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">自由度描述</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"cUZWP\" id=\"cUZWP\"><span data-lake-id=\"u04c28b8d\" id=\"u04c28b8d\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">单连杆固定系统</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u4ad0e153\" id=\"u4ad0e153\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1697701415403-ab41d624-4403-4e84-a3b0-4490a658254a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uec4a9143-d27b-408a-8d4a-8f1805cc257%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u39267d17-216d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A237%2C%22height%22%3A239%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%2214.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A10441%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A306%2C%22originHeight%22%3A308%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub4c410b4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u92e3835f\" id=\"u92e3835f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua224030c\" id=\"ua224030c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">对于这个连杆来说，自由度我们已经确定，只有一个可以旋转的自由度。那么我们如何准确的描述这个连杆的位置呢？</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc86b47ec\" id=\"uc86b47ec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1e024af9\" id=\"u1e024af9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">通常，我们描述起始位置（蓝色点）的坐标，以及旋转的角度，就可以准确的描述出这个连杆的位置和姿态。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"xJrkW\" id=\"xJrkW\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d2fc697\" id=\"u0d2fc697\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">双连杆系统</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u06543c4c\" id=\"u06543c4c\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1697701461104-4a10c779-ea7a-4091-9a2e-48c0cff66b4e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uff47d299-93dd-482e-a9c5-a83887e34fc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u39267d17-216d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A272.55555725097656%2C%22height%22%3A230%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%2215.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A16115%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A386%2C%22originHeight%22%3A326%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u78bea2e0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"vL871\" id=\"vL871\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36b9fd12\" id=\"u36b9fd12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">关节类型和自由度</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uc6735aa6\" id=\"uc6735aa6\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1697701486870-ecf63a28-8b71-446f-8e35-a6877dfb1e56.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u8da56173-e65c-4ba9-9d8b-2f03aa74122%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u39267d17-216d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A449.3333435058594%2C%22height%22%3A253%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%